This repository shares domain concepts (workout/exercise/set, revision-based
synchronization) with, and is a companion to:

- LIFT Android (DugCanLiftCalc) — AGPL-3.0
- LIFT iOS (lift-ios) — AGPL-3.0

No source from those repositories is vendored here.

The Apple Watch application that used to be in this repository (with its
LiftKit package and sync contracts) moved to lift-ios, under `Watch/`, as
LIFT for iPhone's companion app, and is maintained there.
